The instruction encodings (opcode and mask values, operand field positions) in
data/languages/TMS320C54x.slaspec were taken from the opcode table in GNU binutils
(opcodes/tic54x-opc.c, https://sourceware.org/binutils/). No binutils source code is included
in this extension; make_slaspec.py and the SLEIGH specification were written independently.
